{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">屯門一名小學生拿著兩大袋重物，懷疑涉及虐兒，警方拘捕其父母。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">從網上片段見到，富泰邨一名身穿小學校服的女童，拿著兩大袋啤酒，書包打開。由於太重，女童一度要停下休息。期間有途人上前關心，擔心她被虐待。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CHILD-1930_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026epSSF5if0C1791381115.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.CHILD-1930_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">女童父親當時在旁，拖著一個男童和一個女童。據了解，女童學校老師看到網上片段之後報案，懷疑十歲女童受虐。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">警員到場了解，涉案女童聲稱當時正運動，所以手持多瓶啤酒。由於她無表面受傷，警方一度暫列為求警協助。至傍晚稱已拘捕其38歲及32歲父母，已將個案轉交社署跟進。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CHILD-1930_005.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QhhnUhfCpZ1791381138.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.CHILD-1930_005.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">女童學校在社交網站指，將為學生及家庭提供輔導及支援。又呼籲市民不要轉發片段及騷擾學童，擔心造成二次傷害。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T14:39:43.636384+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}